Upstream-Name: RPiUSBHeadTracker
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/torstenknoefel/RPiUSBHeadTracker/issues
Source: https://github.com/torstenknoefel/RPiUSBHeadTracker
Comment: The package contains files that CMake downloads at build time (pinned,
 checked by SHA256): the libraries Crow, taocpp config/json, PEGTL and LCCV
 (compiled into the program), ONNX Runtime (ready-built library), the face
 models, BeerCSS with the Material Symbols fonts, and Barlow Condensed.
 .
 OPEN POINTS before passing the package on: the project itself has no
 licence yet, and LCCV has no licence file in its repository.

